      "content": "idk, \"strength\" feels like a weird word for it. it feels more like just being stuck in a loop. if you look at it logically, there's no actual value in the struggle. if everything is just going to end in nothing anyway, then the math of it all just says it doesn't matter if you're here or not. it's all just zero either way.",
